; worldreopen.eval - the world worldterrain.eval left opens again (code-review
; batch 89). Run by tools\WorldTest.py phase 23, as a SECOND launch: the
; terrain kinds and landing cells that run authored are read back here by
; WorldMap::Load, which asserted on every fault it fixes. Reaching the end of
; this script at all is the first check; what `world` and `worldloc` print is
; the second, since a world that only loaded by losing a square would be worse.
logecho on
reset
world
worldloc
validate
